    "text": "PGA2026 Masters payout, prize money: How much money did Rory McIlroy take home?Juston Lewis Kim LucianiUSA TODAY NETWORK - FloridaUpdated April 12, 2026, 7:14 p.m. ETIt was thrilling a final round at the Masters as it almost promises every year. But in the 90th edition, Rory McIlroy came out on top, making history in the process.After a roller coaster final round, McIlroy won the Masters for the second straight year, carding a 276, one shot better than Scottie Scheffler. He is the fourth man to win the tournament in consecutive years, joining Jack Nicklaus, Nick Faldo and Tiger Woods.",
